msgid ""
"The GPU you chose for %1, at PCI address %2, is not in this computer now."
msgstr "您為%1選擇的 GPU（PCI 位址 %2）現在不在此電腦中。"

#: src/problems.cpp:253
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid "Put the GPU back, or choose another GPU in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr "請把該 GPU 裝回去，或在「系統設定 > 圖形」中選擇另一個 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:257
msgctxt "@info %1 is a PCI address"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose to draw the desktop, at PCI address %1, is in this "
"computer, but no graphics driver is loaded for it."
msgstr ""
"您選擇用來繪製桌面的 GPU（PCI 位址 %1）在此電腦中，但沒有為它載入圖形驅動程"
"式。"

#: src/problems.cpp:260
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 a PCI address"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose for %1, at PCI address %2, is in this computer, but no "
"graphics driver is loaded for it."
msgstr ""
"您為%1選擇的 GPU（PCI 位址 %2）在此電腦中，但沒有為它載入圖形驅動程式。"

#: src/problems.cpp:265
msgctxt "@info %1 is a PCI address, %2 a kernel driver"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose to draw the desktop, at PCI address %1, is in this "
"computer, but its driver, %2, gives it no graphics device."
msgstr ""
"您選擇用來繪製桌面的 GPU（PCI 位址 %1）在此電腦中，但它的驅動程式 %2 沒有為它"
"提供圖形裝置。"

#: src/problems.cpp:269
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 a PCI address, %3 a kernel driver"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose for %1, at PCI address %2, is in this computer, but its "
"driver, %3, gives it no graphics device."
msgstr ""
"您為%1選擇的 GPU（PCI 位址 %2）在此電腦中，但它的驅動程式 %3 沒有為它提供圖形"
"裝置。"

#: src/problems.cpp:274
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid ""
"Install or repair its driver, or choose another GPU in System Settings, "
"Graphics."
msgstr "請安裝或修復它的驅動程式，或在「系統設定 > 圖形」中選擇另一個 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:276
msgctxt "@info why a GPU cannot draw, %1 is a kernel driver"
msgid "its driver, %1, gives it no render node"
msgstr "它的驅動程式 %1 沒有為它提供算繪節點"

#: src/problems.cpp:277
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name, %2 says why"
msgid "The GPU you chose to draw the desktop, %1, cannot draw now: %2."
msgstr "您選擇用來繪製桌面的 GPU %1 現在無法繪製：%2。"

#: src/problems.cpp:278
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 a GPU name, %3 says why"
msgid "The GPU you chose for %1, %2, cannot draw now: %3."
msgstr "您為%1選擇的 GPU %2 現在無法繪製：%3。"

#: src/problems.cpp:279
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid "Choose a GPU that can draw in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr "請在「系統設定 > 圖形」中選擇一個可以繪製的 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:282
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 a GPU name, %3 a device file"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose for %1, %2, cannot be used by your account: %3 cannot be "
"opened."
msgstr "您為%1選擇的 GPU %2 無法由您的帳號使用：無法開啟 %3。"

#: src/problems.cpp:287
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid ""
"Add your account to the render group (sudo adduser $USER render) and log in "
"again, or choose another GPU in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr ""
"請將您的帳號加入 render 群組（sudo adduser $USER render）並重新登入，或在「系"
"統設定 > 圖形」中選擇另一個 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:290
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program"
msgid ""
"You chose the integrated GPU for %1, and this computer has none that can "
"draw now."
msgstr "您為%1選擇了內建 GPU，但此電腦現在沒有可以繪製的內建 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:291
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program"
msgid ""
"You chose the discrete GPU for %1, and this computer has none that can draw "
"now."
msgstr "您為%1選擇了獨立 GPU，但此電腦現在沒有可以繪製的獨立 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:292
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid "Choose another GPU in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr "請在「系統設定 > 圖形」中選擇另一個 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:295
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 says why"
msgid ""
"The GPU for %1 follows the power profile, and the power profile could not be "
"read: %2."
msgstr "%1使用的 GPU 跟隨電源設定檔，但無法讀取電源設定檔：%2。"

#: src/problems.cpp:298
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid ""
"Start power-profiles-daemon (sudo systemctl start power-profiles-daemon), or "
"choose a GPU in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr ""
"請啟動 power-profiles-daemon（sudo systemctl start power-profiles-daemon），"
"或在「系統設定 > 圖形」中選擇一個 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:301
msgctxt "@info %1 is a file"
msgid ""
"The machine's GPU record, %1, could not be written. Until it is, Automatic "
"treats this computer as not measured. Run: sudo sparky-stereo-gpu-record --"
"apply-known"
msgstr ""
"無法寫入本機的 GPU 紀錄 %1。在寫入之前，「自動」會把此電腦視為未測量。請執"
"行：sudo sparky-stereo-gpu-record --apply-known"

#: src/problems.cpp:306
msgctxt "@info %1 is an exit status"
msgid ""
"systemd could not reload its units after the Graphics page was installed "
"(exit status %1). The boot service that writes the machine's GPU record may "
"not start. Run: sudo systemctl daemon-reload"
msgstr ""
"安裝「圖形」頁面後，systemd 無法重新載入其單元（結束狀態 %1）。寫入本機 GPU "
"紀錄的開機服務可能無法啟動。請執行：sudo systemctl daemon-reload"

#: src/problems.cpp:310
msgctxt "@info %1 is a file"
msgid "A kept problem of the Graphics page cannot be read: %1."
msgstr "無法讀取「圖形」頁面保存的問題：%1。"

#: src/problems.cpp:313
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "At this login the desktop draws on the GPU the system picks."
msgstr "本次登入時，桌面由系統選定的 GPU 繪製。"
